    "39033": {
      "passed": false,
      "rationale_chunks_concat_exact": [
        "All ten seed-39033 records and every actual projected field were read through the packet end. The same per-ID column sets, units, exact catalogue strings and product/process distinctions are maintained across all three seeds. TG-420 and TG-042 remain distinct models; PACE identifiers are explicit catalogue identities of complete shoes, not components or row keys. b031/b032 do not become temperature probes through the negated sensor phrase; b035's no-water statement does not become a positive measured depth; b036 remains a commercial ledger rather than performance data. Every record's CSV/PDF format agrees with its explicit content synopsis, a",
        "nd optional distributions repeat identical per-record columns: b032 PDF, b038 PDF, b039 PDF, b040 PDF. Verification is metadata/content association only. No actual field supports either frozen no-answer conjunction. Titles use common location/topic frames and filler is repetitive; nevertheless real phrasing, order, length, paragraph and optional-field changes exist, not solely different titles. For example b031 changes a short distribution-directed account into a long inline-column account, b034 becomes a short distribution-directed account instead of the longer seed-39031 account, and b039 uses an observational-study opening instead of the s",
        "eed-39032 physical-observation opening. No duplicate whole records or answer-key/grade/intent leakage was observed. Variable concepts are preserved, but literal numeric and attribution facts are not. Seed-39033 examples are b031 dimensions 96.59, b032 dimensions 118.05, b033 friction/roughness 0.83/0.52, b034 friction 0.37, b035 mass 665.05, b036 price 55.92/carton 315 x 90 x 65, b037 friction/roughness/depth 0.64/0.99/0.41, b038 0.68/0.8/0.48, b039 0.7/1.19, b040 friction 0.44. These exact examples are quoted in record facts and differ from the other seeds. The examples are marked e.g., so a scientific contradiction is not established, but s",
        "trict all-facts-preserved cannot be asserted without deciding whether such numeric and attribution perturbation is permitted. This plus b036's unsupported experimental-basis encoding keeps this variation result unresolved. Actual query texts are absent, so paraphrase equivalence and designated exact-query lookup requirements cannot be independently assessed; catalogue identity here means only the explicit assertion in the provided actual description. No external identity authority, distribution bytes or full-corpus coverage was checked."
